                                "sense_id": "8dd694ce-f29b-320f-a700-f228af920002",
                                "text": "Just when it seems she is ready to say something to Max, the phone rings again. This time she reaches quickly for the phone. “Yello?” acting like it is her own personal phone."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "22533182-b33a-4bb3-ae77-071cc2973eab",
                                "sense_id": "8dd694ce-f29b-320f-a700-f228af920002",
                                "text": "The phone rings a fifth time. Eddie pulls the phone from underneath the driver's seat and places it to his ear. “Yello?” The phone rings again."
